# Defra AI Toolkit — Keeping data safe
# https://digital.defra.gov.uk/ai-toolkit/guidance/keeping-data-safe
# https://digital.defra.gov.uk/ai-toolkit/guidance/security
#
# Exclude files that may contain real credentials, secrets, or classified content
# from Copilot's context window.
#
# IMPORTANT: Base project files (packages.config, *.csproj, web.config,
# appsettings.json) are intentionally NOT excluded — the pdf-discovery agent
# reads these to fingerprint the PDF library and locate licence key references.

# Environment variable files
.env
.env.*
*.env

# Environment-specific appsettings (may contain real connection strings)
appsettings.Production.json
appsettings.Production.*.json
appsettings.Staging.json
appsettings.Staging.*.json
appsettings.Live.json
appsettings.UAT.json

# Config transforms (may contain production connection strings or SMTP credentials)
Web.Release.config
Web.Staging.config
Web.Live.config
Web.UAT.config

# Private keys and certificates
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem

# Test data that may contain real personal data
**/TestData/real-*
**/testdata/real-*
**/fixtures/real-*

# CI/CD pipeline secrets
.github/secrets/
**/pipeline-secrets*

# OFFICIAL-SENSITIVE documents
**/*OFFICIAL-SENSITIVE*
**/*official-sensitive*
